OL,3,AFired OpenAI researchers say they were
OL,4,Alet go for 'prioritising safety'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree former OpenAI researchers sacked
OL,7,Ffor allegedly mishandling information
OL,8,Fclaim they were instead let go because
OL,9,Fthey raised safety concerns at the tech
OL,10,Ffirm.
OL,12,F"I believe we were fired for
OL,13,Fprioritising safety over the near-term
OL,14,Finterests of OpenAI as a corporation,"
OL,15,FMikita Balesni posted on X alongside an
OL,16,Fopen letter to the ChatGPT-maker,
OL,17,Fwritten with fellow ex-employees.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
